                                                 owl:onProperty <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001986> ;
                                                 owl:someValuesFrom :Target_Track_Point_Information_Content_Entity
                                               ] ;
                               rdfs:label "Act of Target Location Change" ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Location Change in which an Agent alters the spatial region or site occupied by a material entity designated as a target." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Act_of_Target_Vulnerability_Window_Estimation
