                            <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001749> "CCO" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Circular_Error_90_Measurement
:Circular_Error_90_Measurement rdf:type owl:Class ;
                               rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000731> ,
