                                               ] ;
                               owl:disjointWith :Linear_Error_90_Measurement ;
                               rdfs:label "Circular Error 90% Measurement" ;
                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Deviation Measurement that is a horizontal positional accuracy metric defined as the radius of a circle in the horizontal plane within which 90% of measured positions, target coordinates, or impacts are expected to fall relative to the true position or aimpoint." ;
                               <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001749> "CE90" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Dynamic_Target
