                        <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001748> "RTL" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Rules_of_Engagement
:Rules_of_Engagement rdf:type owl:Class ;
                     rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001324> ;
                     rdfs:label "Rules of Engagement" ;
                     <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001737> "A Process Regulation that represents directives issued by competent miltary authorities that delineate the circumstances and limiations under which US Forces will initiate and/or continue combat engagement with other foreces encountered." ;
                     <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001745> "DoD Dictionary (2018)" ;
                     <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001749> "ROE" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Senior_Intelligence_Duty_Officer
:Senior_Intelligence_Duty_Officer rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001262>
                                                                             [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
