                                                                                        ]
                                                                                      ) ;
                                                                   rdf:type owl:Class
                                                                 ]
                                            ] ;
                            rdfs:label "Target Location Identifier" ;
                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Measurement Unit of Geocoordinate that is comprised a geocoordinate that can describe x, y, z axis of a location." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Target_Role
:Target_Role rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023> ;
             rdfs:label "Target Role" ;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Role that is realized by a Process that some Agent is the object of a potential action given some operational requirement." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Target_Track_Information_Content_Entity
