                                         <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "DoD Dictionary (2018)" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Target_Track_Point_Information_Content_Entity
:Target_Track_Point_Information_Content_Entity rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> ,
