                                                               ] ;
                                               rdfs:label "Target Track Point Information Content Entity" ;
                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Descriptive Information Conent Entity that describes a site that a Target occupies at a point or interval of time." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Target_Track_Status_Information_Content_Entity
:Target_Track_Status_Information_Content_Entity rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000293> ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001808> ;
                                                                  owl:someValuesFrom :Target_Track_Information_Content_Entity
                                                                ] ,
                                                                [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                  owl:onProperty <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001808> ;
                                                                  owl:someValuesFrom <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000544>
                                                                ] ;
                                                rdfs:label "Target Track Status Information Content Entity" ;
                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Nominal Measurement Information Content Entity that classifies the current operational or lifecycle state of a Target Track (such as tentative, confirmed, coasting, or dropped) based on the continuity and confidence of its position updates." .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Target_Vulnerability_Window
:Target_Vulnerability_Window rdf:type owl:Class ;
                             rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000202> ;
                             rdfs:label "Target Vulnerabilty Window" ;
                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Temporal Interval during which a target is simultaneously exposed, detectable, identifiable, and susceptible to effective strike or engagement by friendly forces." ;
                             <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001753> "TVW" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Target_Vulnerability_Window_Estimate_Information_Content_Entity
:Target_Vulnerability_Window_Estimate_Information_Content_Entity rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                 rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000745> ,
                                                                                 [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                                   owl:onProperty <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001966> ;
                                                                                   owl:someValuesFrom :Target_Vulnerability_Window
                                                                                 ] ;
                                                                 rdfs:label "Target Vulnerability Window Estimate Information Content Entity" ;
                                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Point Estimate Information Content Entity that is a measurement of the predicted or approximated duration of a temporal region during which a target is exposed, identifiable, and susceptible to effective strike by friendly forces." ;
                                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "This metric reflects the actionable overlap between adversary exposure (dwell time), sensor custody, and friendly engagement timelines during dynamic or time-sensitive targeting." .


